34
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,900
Exactly.

35
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:07,060
Studying the company is very important.

36
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:12,140
If the interviewer asks why you want the job, you don't want your answer to sound weak.

37
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:17,980
Yes, I said something like, I like the job and it seems interesting and I could see they

38
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:19,780
