39
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:24,820
Instead, you could say something like, I admire how your company focuses on customer

40
00:02:24,820 --> 00:02:29,260
satisfaction and innovation and I want to contribute to this mission.

41
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:33,020
Here and simple English is enough if the idea is strong.

42
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,540
I understand.

43
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:38,860
Next time I'll spend more time reading about the company and thinking about why I want

44
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:39,860
